    CORE <-->|"fixed domain commands / events"| B
    M <-->|"control + worker protocol"| B
    M <-->|"TLS SQL"| DB
    CORE <-->|"TLS SQL"| DB
    B <-->|"config · heartbeat · sensor · actuator"| W1
